-//! A --tp 2 prompt chunk as two halves a layer apart: each half's expert exchange runs on a side stream and
-//! communicator while the pass's stream computes the other half (TF_FLASHNEXT_PROMPT_OVERLAP).
-//!
-//! Half A (the chunk's first rows) runs each layer before half B, on the same stream, so B reads A's keys, values,
